编辑：
```ts
function openEdit(): void {
  if (!detail.value) return
  editForm.name = detail.value.name
  editForm.description = detail.value.description
  editForm.content = detail.value.content ?? ''
  editOpen.value = true
}
async function submitEdit(): Promise<void> {
  if (editing.value || !detail.value) return
  const name = editForm.name.trim()
  if (!name) { ElMessage.warning('名称不能为空'); return }
  editing.value = true
  try {
    const updated = await skillsApi.update(detail.value.id, {
      name,
      description: editForm.description.trim(),
      content: editForm.content,
    })
    detail.value = { ...detail.value, ...updated }
    // 更新列表项
    const idx = items.value.findIndex((item) => item.id === updated.id)
    if (idx >= 0) items.value[idx] = { ...items.value[idx], ...updated }
    capabilities.invalidate()
    editOpen.value = false
    ElMessage.success('已保存技能')
  } catch (cause) {
    ElMessage.error(cause instanceof Error ? cause.message : '保存失败')
  } finally {
    editing.value = false
  }
}
```

注意 `items.value[idx] = ...`，idx 可能 -1，用 if 判断。noUncheckedIndexedAccess 会让 `items.value[idx]` 读取返回 `Skill | undefined`，但赋值是允许的（写访问不加 undefined）。`items.value[idx] = {...}` 左侧是 `Skill`（写入）。但 `{...items.value[idx], ...updated}` 里读取 `items.value[idx]` 返回 `Skill | undefined`，展开 undefined 会报错？展开 `Skill | undefined` 会报 "Spread types may only be created from object types"。所以我需要先取出 item。

改为：
```ts
const existing = items.value.find((item) => item.id === updated.id)
if (existing) Object.assign(existing, updated)
```
这样避免索引问题。

